3ca" facs="#m-594ebbe9-5ecf-4973-8d15-8430427d5f3b" label="text-like">Chapter and Hymn of second Vespers, p. 1504.</l><l xml:id="m-ce9ff69e-cd9e-4b69-aa38-f5e06b07c812" facs="#m-c69e28f1-ece8-4699-8ca6-04b048967a09" label="lyrics-like">V. Fúit hómo míssus a Déo. R. Cúi nómen érat Joánnes.</l><l xml:id="m-c169ad2c-e802-4290-8c7b-998376f29b7d" facs="#m-9813b8e2-e134-4f23-b587-0b312bca5c10" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-d88ed3ef-064b-4029-8b51-c731a4b2a8b3" facs="#m-e5bea8f6-a054-469f-b05b-9f5a6f0fa63c" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-74a3ca14-770e-4725-8b3c-756e4693dbfd" facs="#m-1ca59624-65b5-43ff-9f63-14f2c54c764b" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-a9d61cc2-6fbd-40c2-b002-cd1309cd0630" facs="#m-ca96c82d-6852-4219-b413-6c7cfd73ab1a" label="lyrics-like">Ngrésso"“ Zacha-rí-a témplum Dómi-ni,</l><l xml:id="m-5d325d1a-72e5-4d5e-bdec-26be280b57f1" facs="#m-bf252c4f-c013-4312-80bb-6d430fa6b316" label="lyrics-like">appá-ru-it é- i Gábri-el Ange-lus, stans a déxtris</l><l xml:id="m-f1a163f9-2717-430d-ab1d-efccac60fda7" facs="#m-d095ab75-5bc1-496a-a5a8-b0d8bc01b556" label="lyrics-like">altá- ris incénsi. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5eb769f0-fdce-4e0f-a5f0-5cde8402f8e6" facs="#m-e9028f8f-85b1-45ad-9148-bd434f05157f" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212 or p. 218.</l><l xml:id="m-753fd39e-e67a-4d6b-906f-f888b68190f4" facs="#m-958e8e00-f5fc-4119-a27d-6917fb552877" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui praeséntem. p. 1500.</l><l xml:id="m-43bc713b-c6c3-4fc3-a4fc-15f14d7eb34d" facs="#m-8daa139c-7359-417f-a86b-6a9eee56a4f9" label="text-like">AT LAUDS.</l><l xml:id="m-752845fa-4511-4918-9e0b-4260b07fa19b" facs="#m-ef6a6c92-cc96-4c89-880c-a65d158f21b2" label="text-like">Antiphons of second Vespers, p. 1503. Psalms of Feasts, p. 221.</l><l xml:id="m-7d9ffbe6-c3d1-45c9-9e1c-688f2935eefd" facs="#m-6b7b0a36-f348-41ce-932d-886a74b80058" label="ambiguous">Chapter. Audite insulae. D. 1504.</l><l xml:id="m-c90f08ef-09ca-44bb-aaa5-9